<title>SOUTH KOREA: S.Korean firms to seek 31,000 T rapeseed meal.</title>
<headline>S.Korean firms to seek 31,000 T rapeseed meal.</headline>
<dateline>SEOUL 1997-05-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>A South Korean buyer group, known as the Feed Buying Group, has invited tenders to buy 31,000 tonnes of rapeseed meal by 11:30 a.m. (0230 GMT) on Friday, traders said on Wednesday.</p>
<p>They said the buyer group had also invited tenders to buy 13,500 tonnes of cottonseed meal and 11,500 tonnes of palm kernel meal on the same day.</p>
